{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13506","headline":"途次维扬望京口寄白下诸公 · 蒋涣","name":"途次维扬望京口寄白下诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北望情何限，南行路转深。\n晚帆低荻叶，寒日下枫林。\n云白兰陵渚，烟青建业岑。\n江天秋向尽，无处不伤心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}